{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16986","headline":"奉酬中书李相公早朝於中书候传点偶书所怀 · 武元衡","name":"奉酬中书李相公早朝於中书候传点偶书所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥落曙锺断，微明烟月沈。\n翠霞仙仗合，清漏掖垣深。\n北极星遥拱，南山阙迥临。\n兰釭竟晓焰，琪树欲秋阴。\n霄汉慙联步，貂蝉媿并簪。\n德容温比玉，王度式如金。\n鱼水千里运，箫韶九奏音。\n代天惊度日，掷地喜开襟。\n文武时方泰，唐虞道可寻。\n忝陪申及甫，清净奉尧心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}